1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,679
And now let's get into the 15 facts that will provide you comfort in your times of loneliness.
现在来看十五个“事实”，它们会在你孤独时给你安慰。

2
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:15,080
Fact number one you're so busy looking around at everyone else thinking why not me why doesn't my life look like that why don't I have those friends.
第一，你忙着看周围所有人，想着：“为什么不是我？我的生活为什么不是那样？我为什么没有那些朋友？”

3
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,959
That your loneliness is stuck in a negative state.
以至于你的孤独停在一种消极状态里。

4
00:00:17,959 --> 00:00:22,720
Loneliness is simply having a negative perception on being being alone.
孤独不过是对独处的一种负面看法（原字幕重复 being）。

5
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:30,319
But being alone isn't a bad thing being alone isn't something you need to be sad about in fact it can bring you so much joy and fulfillment and contentment.
但独处不是坏事，也不是你需要为之难过的事；事实上，它能给你很多快乐、充实与满足。

6
00:00:30,319 --> 00:00:35,319
Loneliness is simply created from having an external focus an external locus of control.
孤独只是由向外关注、外在控制源造成的，

7
00:00:35,319 --> 00:00:39,000
Because you believe other people are the answer but that's not the case.
因为你相信别人是答案，但事实并不是这样。

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,440
You can so easily convert your loneliness into solitude by finally looking at yourself.
只要最终把目光转向自己，你就很容易把孤独转化为独处，

9
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:50,520
And by shifting your perception to one that celebrates all of those moments of being alone.
把看法转向庆祝每一个独处的时刻。

10
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:58,160
Two lonely is all in your belief that no one cares for you and no one's going to be there for you and no one likes you.
第二，孤独全在于你相信没有人在乎你，没有人会支持你，也没人喜欢你。

11
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:03,959
And this is an example of a scarcity mindset because it does not matter how many times you've been hurt or burned in the past.
这是匮乏心态的一种表现，因为不管你过去受过多少次伤、吃过多少次亏，

12
00:01:03,959 --> 00:01:06,360
This is not the case for your present moment.
那都不是你当下的情况。

13
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:11,000
A lot of the time we make the mistake of using our past to define our present.
很多时候，我们犯了一个错误：用过去来定义现在。

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:18,080
And it takes away all of the joy and all of the gratitude and happiness and love that a lot of the time is right in front of us away from us.
这夺走了很多时候就在我们眼前的快乐、感恩、幸福和爱，

15
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:20,080
Because we're only ever living in the past.
因为我们一直只活在过去。

16
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:29,840
We're so consumed by the way that we've been that we're taking situations that have already happened and that literally don't exist anymore and living our life in accordance to them.
我们太被过去的状态占据，把已经发生、甚至已经不存在的情况拿来，照着它们生活。

17
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:34,800
Therefore just causing a deeper pit of sadness for ourselves which is actually so far from the truth.
因此只是为自己造成更深的悲伤深坑，而那实际上离真相很远。

18
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:42,360
And this leads me on to three loneliness is simply the result of an absence of yourself.
这就引出第三点：孤独不过是你自身缺席的结果。

19
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:49,399
Because listen let's say technically you don't have anyone no one's there for you no one's shown up for you in the way that you wished they would.
听我说，假设严格说来你身边没有任何人：没人支持你，也没人像你期待的那样为你出现。

20
00:01:49,399 --> 00:01:52,039
But you're there for you you're always going to have you.
但你会支持自己，你永远都会拥有自己。

21
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:56,080
You the only person that's been by your own side every single second of your life.
你是唯一在生命每一秒都陪在自己身边的人。

22
00:01:56,080 --> 00:02:02,519
You the only person on this planet that knows yourself the most no one will ever understand you like you do.
你是这个星球上最了解自己的人，没有人会像你一样理解你。

23
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:08,360
So this feeling of loneliness is trying to teach you something it's trying to teach you that you're number one.
所以，这种孤独感想教会你一些东西：它想教会你，你是第一位的。

24
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:11,920
It's your body telling you hey look at me pay attention to me.
这是身体在告诉你：“嘿，看看我，关注我。”

25
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:18,200
Because this is a chance for you to be able to show up for yourself and it has the power to change the trajectory of your life.
因为这是一个为自己出现、支持自己的机会，它有力量改变你人生的轨迹。

26
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,320
I experienced so much loneliness throughout all of my teen years.
我整个青少年时期都经历过很多孤独。

27
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:32,590
And as soon soon as I started realizing this and having this mindset shift that hey what if I give myself everything that I'm seeking from others my relationship with myself transformed.
我一开始意识到这一点，转变心态，想“如果我把向别人寻求的一切都给自己呢”，我和自己的关系就改变了。

28
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:35,559
I had never seen it that way that I could give myself everything.
我以前从没这样看过：我可以把一切都给自己，

29
00:02:35,559 --> 00:02:39,640
And that I am my number one best friend and that I am the love of my own life.
我是自己最好的朋友，也是自己一生的挚爱。

30
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:42,960
And anything I seek from others I can already give it to myself.
我从别人那里寻求的任何东西，都已经可以给自己。

31
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:46,430
And I also want you to understand that loneliness isn't a curse.
我也希望你明白，孤独不是诅咒。

32
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:52,670
You were given this feeling you were given this life and these circumstances because you are strong enough to live it.
你被赋予这种感受、这样的人生和处境，是因为你足够坚强，能够承受。

33
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:58,680
Four guess what you're not surrounded by bad energy you're not surrounded by misaligned friends.
第四，猜猜怎么着？你没有被坏能量包围，没有被不合拍的朋友包围。

34
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:05,080
You're not chasing people for the sake of having company wow actually wow.
你没有只为了有人陪就去追着别人跑。哇，真的，哇。

35
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:15,160
Listen it is much better in fact it is a win to spend time alone rather than surrounding yourself with people who can't match your light or who can't deserve your energy.
听着，与其和无法匹配你的光芒、不配得到你精力的人在一起，独处好得多，实际上是一次胜利。

36
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:26,360
You are finally in a place where you will accept loneliness because you finally care more about your wellbeing than what other people think about you.
你终于到了愿意接受孤独的地方，因为比起别人怎么看你，你终于更在乎自己的身心状态。

37
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,119
Round of applause honestly.
说真的，值得鼓掌。
